      "description": "<p>WARNING: DUE TO GOOGLE DRIVE DELETING FILES WHEN UNZIPPED DOWNLOAD BOBBY’s MUSIC PLAYER FIRST AND THEN THIS MOD. MOVE ONLY THE AUDIO FILES NOT THE DLL. ALT SOLUTION: Download the ZIP files from my link in Bobby’s Mod Page and then unzip them to a folder or desktop</p>\n<p>Mod adds Music from Touhou Under the Moonlight or it’s JP name, Touhou Motto Fushigi no Gensyoko. It’s apart of a series called Touhou Chronicles or as some people may know it as: Genso Wanderer Reloaded etc. anyway, felt the need to explain where it’s from.</p>\n<p>Install: Drag BepinEx Folder into SPT directory</p>\n<p>This is a submod for Bobby’s Main menu Replacer mod. as such it requires it.</p>\n<p>Preview: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/38xyFTk3FhM?si=50z4OjxpC2VFm6zN\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://youtu.be/38xyFTk3FhM?si=50z4OjxpC2VFm6zN</a></p>\n<p>Updated to SPT 3.11 version</p>\n",
